st holy things until there was a priest to consult the Urim and Thummim.","from":1},{"book":"EZR","chapter":8,"verse":19,"verseEnd":19,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"also Hashabiah, together with Jeshaiah, from the descendants of Merari, and his brothers and their sons, 20 men.","from":11},{"book":"EZR","chapter":8,"verse":24,"verseEnd":24,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Then I set apart twelve of the leading priests, together with Sherebiah, Hashabiah, and ten of their brothers,","from":11},{"book":"EZR","chapter":10,"verse":21,"verseEnd":21,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"From the descendants of Harim: Maaseiah, Elijah, Shemaiah, Jehiel, and Uzziah.","from":8},{"book":"EZR","chapter":10,"verse":23,"verseEnd":23,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Among the Levites: Jozabad, Shimei, Kelaiah (that is, Kelita), Pethahiah, Judah, and Eliezer.","from":10},{"book":"NEH","chapter":1,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"These are the words of Nehemiah son of Hacaliah: In the month of Chislev, in the twentieth year, while I was in the citadel of Susa,","from":1},{"book":"NEH","chapter":3,"verse":4,"verseEnd":4,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Next to them, Meremoth son of Uriah, the son of Hakkoz, made repairs. Next to him, Meshullam son of Berechiah, the son of Meshezabel, made repairs; and next to him, Zadok son of Baana made repairs as well.","from":5},{"book":"NEH","chapter":3,"verse":6,"verseEnd":6,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The Jeshanah Gate was repaired by Joiada son of Paseah and Meshullam son of Besodeiah. They laid its beams and installed its doors, bolts, and bars.","from":7}],"notes":[],"groups":[]},"14-27":{"people":[{"id":"bani-h1137n","name":"Bani","kind":"person","brief":"Returned leader","count":1,"firstVerse":14},{"id":"elam-h5867i","name":"Elam","kind":"person","brief":"Returned leader","count":1,"firstVerse":14},{"id":"pahath-moab-h6355i","name":"Pahath-moab","kind":"person","brief":"Returned leader","count":1,"firstVerse":14},